ion","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wudi-q-o078"]},{"id":"xianzhu-m-o020-wudi-p0116","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["xianzhu-q-o020"]},{"id":"zhangle-m-o020-wudi-p0116","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["zhangle-q-o020"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-e-o040c-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-c71d10ef121af30ac6b7","layer":"original","quote":"汝南、颍川黄巾何仪、刘辟、黄邵、何曼等〖4〗，众各数万。初应袁术，又附孙坚〖5〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":258,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":83,"end":124},{"id":"wudi-e-o041a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-e5b982c166562445d210","layer":"original","quote":"二月，太祖进军讨破之，斩辟、邵等〖6〗，仪及其众皆降。天子拜太祖建德将军〖7〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":259,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":40},{"id":"wudi-e-o078b-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-1a4793df0505fd3101f2","layer":"original","quote":"汝南降贼刘辟等，叛应绍，略许下〖1〗。绍使刘备助辟，公使曹仁击破之。备走，遂破辟屯。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":434,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":23,"end":65},{"id":"wudi-q-b-16a5462151b1cfe5142d","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-16a5462151b1cfe5142d","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗建安元年：公元 196 年。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":264,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-df2756e12f4ac1fef3c4","start":0,"end":17},{"id":"wudi-q-b-9900125064e5d85f08ad","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-9900125064e5d85f08ad","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗五年：建安五年（公元 200）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":403,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-744e4aee7f5ff14cca85","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"wudi-q-o040","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-c71d10ef121af30ac6b7","layer":"original","quote":"建安元年春正月〖1〗，太祖军临武平〖2〗。袁术所置陈相袁嗣，降。太祖将迎天子，诸将或疑；荀彧、程昱劝之。乃遣曹洪将兵西迎。卫将军董承与袁术将苌奴拒险〖3〗，洪不得进。汝南、颍川黄巾何仪、刘辟、黄邵、何曼等〖4〗，众各数万。初应袁术，又附孙坚〖5〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":258,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":124},{"id":"wudi-q-o041","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-e5b982c166562445d210","layer":"original","quote":"二月，太祖进军讨破之，斩辟、邵等〖6〗，仪及其众皆降。天子拜太祖建德将军〖7〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":259,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":40},{"id":"wudi-q-o071","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-c9f735ddad48a8f5c2b6","layer":"original","quote":"五年春正月〖1〗，董承等谋泄，皆伏诛。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":400,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":19},{"id":"wudi-q-o078","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-1a4793df0505fd3101f2","layer":"original","quote":"孙策闻公与绍相持，乃谋袭许；未发，为刺客所杀。汝南降贼刘辟等，叛应绍，略许下〖1〗。绍使刘备助辟，公使曹仁击破之。备走，遂破辟屯。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":434,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":65},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o022a-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-36cfff1e8c8cf56e720f","layer":"original","quote":"太祖与袁绍，久相持于官渡。绍遣刘备徇！强诸县〖1〗，多举众应之；自许以南，吏民不安。太祖以为忧。仁曰：“南方以大军方有目前急，其势不能相救；刘备以强兵临之，其背叛，固宜也。备新将绍兵，未能得其用，击之可破也。”太祖善其言，遂使将骑击备；破走之，仁尽复收诸叛县而还。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":117,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":132},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o020a-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-b25bb3f6fa26f880ffc6","layer":"original","quote":"曹公与袁绍相拒于官渡，汝南黄巾刘辟等，叛曹公应绍。绍遣先主将兵与辟等略许下〖5〗。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":91,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":41},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o020c-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-b25bb3f6fa26f880ffc6","layer":"original","quote":"曹公遣曹仁将兵击先主。先主还绍军，","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":91,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":49,"end":66},{"id":"xianzhu-q-b-48b6a5909923ebbdbdcf","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-48b6a5909923ebbdbdcf","layer":"modern","quote":"〖9〗五年：建安五年（公元 200）。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":83,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-8b68ef31f073da72a52f","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"xianzhu-q-o018","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-ad5eaaeb0ac8302cb92c","layer":"original","quote":"五年〖9〗，曹公东征先主，先主败绩。﹝五﹞曹公尽收其众，虏先主妻子；并擒关羽以归。先主走青州。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":73,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":47},{"id":"xianzhu-q-o020","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-b25bb3f6fa26f880ffc6","layer":"original","quote":"曹公与袁绍相拒于官渡，汝南黄巾刘辟等，叛曹公应绍。绍遣先主将兵与辟等略许下〖5〗。关羽亡，归先主。曹公遣曹仁将兵击先主。先主还绍军，阴欲离绍，乃说绍南连荆州牧刘表。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":91,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":82},{"id":"zhangle-q-o020","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-268a3271c0ec48659996","layer":"original","quote":"及太祖领兖州，禁与其党俱诣，为都伯〖2〗，属将军王朗。朗异之，荐禁才任大将（军）。太祖召见，与语，拜军司马；使将兵诣徐州，攻广戚；拔之，拜陷阵都尉。从讨吕布于濮阳，别破布二营于城南；又别将破高雅于须昌。从攻寿张、定陶、离狐〖3〗，围张超于雍丘，皆拔之。从征黄巾刘辟、黄邵等，屯版梁；邵等夜袭太祖营，禁帅麾下击破之，斩（辟）邵等，尽降其众。迁平虏校尉〖4〗。从围桥蕤于苦，斩蕤等四将。从至宛，降张绣。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":72,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":199}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
